#ASSERT `s 486A(5)(a) the company commits an offence` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 486A(5)(b) the officer commits an offence` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 486A(5)(b) the officer commits an offence` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 486A(5)(b) the officer commits an offence` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 486A(5)(b) the officer commits an offence` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 486A(6) the penalty for an offence under section 486A` EQUALS Penalty WITH `how convicted` IS `on summary conviction`, `imprisonment not exceeding` IS NOTHING, `fine not exceeding` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 1), `daily default fine for continued contravention` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 0.1), `imprisonment and fine together` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 486A(6) the most the person can be fined on summary conviction, in pounds` 2000 EQUALS 2000
